    <cap:headline>Heavy Rain</cap:headline>
    <cap:description>Heavy to Very Heavy Rainfall at a few places with Extremely Heavy Falls at isolated places very likely over south Konkan, Goa; Heavy to Very Heavy Rainfall at isolated places over north Konkan, ghat areas of Madhya Maharashtra, Kerala, Mahe, Coastal Karnataka and South Interior Karnataka (Coastal and adjoining ghat areas)</cap:description>
    <cap:instruction>Action suggested:
•	Avoid going to areas that face the water logging problems often.
•	Avoid staying in vulnerable structure.
•	Check for traffic congestion on your route before journey.</cap:instruction>
    <cap:web>https://mausam.imd.gov.in/imd_latest/contents/subdivisionwise-warning.php</cap:web>
